# dkim2.com: Mailman submits on 127.0.0.1:10572 (smtp_port). Every Mailman
# list on this box is a DKIM2 list -- patched ones record their own instance,
# the dkim2stock* ones rely on the snapshot diff -- so every
# @mailman.dkim2.com sender goes to the signer on 10587. Anything else Mailman
# sends (none expected) goes out unsigned. Installed by deploy/deploy.sh.
/@mailman\.dkim2\.com$/    FILTER smtp:[127.0.0.1]:10587
